on":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12206030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12206030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220603001:0":{"text":"작은 숲이라면 여기인 것 같네요.","source_cn":"小树林，应该就是这里了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D46A341029A2068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1220603002:0":{"text":"마스터, 어서 들어가죠!","source_cn":"主人，我们进去吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D886401DCE5EEAD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 어서 들어가죠!","female":"마스터, 어서 들어가죠!","variant_male_record_index":"134424","variant_female_record_index":"134425","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12206040.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12206040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12206040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220604001:1":{"text":"오지 마! 한 발자국만 더 가까이 오면 가만두지 않을 거야!","source_cn":"站住！再敢靠近一步，我就不客气了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F59B31CD801E1A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220604002:1":{"text":"가만두지 않으면, 뭐? 한 대 치게?","source_cn":"来啊，快来打我啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58613A94EE1670D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220604003:1":{"text":"무시하지 마!","source_cn":"别小看人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F450DC3C94563DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220604004:1":{"text":"겨우 이거야? 그 정도 힘으로는 개미도 못 죽인다고!","source_cn":"噢，就这么点力气吗？这种力道也算打人？真让人发笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEDFBE1F7BB3CCF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220604005:1":{"text":"그만 놀리고, 저 꼬마의 손에 있는 물건이 괜찮아 보이는데 어서 뺏어와!","source_cn":"别跟她废话了，她手里的东西很不错，抢过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF07EE18190ED02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220604006:0":{"text":"이거 놔! 이 나쁜 자식들!","source_cn":"放手！你们这群混蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DCF5D6DBA788FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1220604006":{"text":"이거 놔! 이 나쁜 자식들!","source_cn":"放手！你们这群混蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DCF5D6DBA788FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220604007:0":{"text":"넌 또 뭐야? 우리한테 돈이라도 상납하러 온 거야?","source_c